{"id":1302,"name":"Itai no wa Iya nano de Bougyoryoku ni Kyokufuri Shitai to Omoimasu.","slug":"itai_no_wa_iya_nano_de_bougyoryoku_ni_kyokufuri_shitai_to_omoimasu","synopsis":"The story centers on Kaede Honjou, who is invited by her friend Risa Shiramine to play a virtual reality MMO game with her. While Kaede doesn't dislike games, what she really, truly dislikes is being in pain. She creates a character named Maple, and decides to put all her points in VIT to minimize pain. As a result, she moves slowly, can't use magic, and even a rabbit can get the best of her. However, as it turns out, she acquires a skill known as \"Absolute Defense\" as a result of her pumping points into VIT, as well as a \"Counter Skill\" that works against special moves. Now, with her ability to nullify all damage, she goes on adventures.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network, edited)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2020,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:58","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 03:33:50","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":38790},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":106479},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":42043},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":14523},{"site":"ANN","externalId":22565},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":12550},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":81234294},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2595,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/kWGoeRfr5drdEkLQYUYTAtlopcT3OU4LNjqtPIjE.png"},{"id":2596,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/1JbDbiSy6BaQ620CH21eVfYeDsb9Kwd8lIrNr5sl.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":59,"name":"SILVER LINK.","slug":"silver_link"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":259,"name":"Itai no wa Iya nano de Bougyoryoku ni Kyokufuri Shitai to Omoimasu.","slug":"itai_no_wa_iya_nano_de_bougyoryoku_ni_kyokufuri_shitai_to_omoimasu"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":10009,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":10010,"ti